# The KeyBy contract: one key decides `==`, ordering, Map lookup and Set
# membership. Both spellings of an Email find one entry and `==` agrees; a
# path keys by its list of components, which orders item by item with a
# shorter prefix first; re-inserting an equal key replaces the value and
# keeps the first stored key; Set union and intersection keep the receiver's
# values and difference keeps its own; iteration follows key order; a key may
# be another KeyBy type. Every tier prints the same. The refusals: a fallible
# or effectful key, a written Equatable or a trait marker beside KeyBy, a
# Shared field, a key cycle and a Float key.
fixture: d_key_traits1_contract.fixture
env: NO_COLOR=1
env: JET_STORE_DIR={work}/cache
env: JETPACK_ROOT={work}/jetpack
env: JETPACK_ENV=1
step o0: jet run -O0 main.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = d_key_traits1_contract.stdout.expected
stderr: empty
step o1: jet run -O1 main.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = d_key_traits1_contract.stdout.expected
stderr: empty
step o2: jet run -O2 main.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = d_key_traits1_contract.stdout.expected
stderr: empty
step fallible: jet check fallible/main.jet
exit: 1
stderr: ~ "`Email.key` can fail with `Err`" # an error suffix on the key
stderr: ~ "jet-lang.dev/e/E0502" # the KeyBy contract code
step effectful: jet check effectful/main.jet
exit: 1
stderr: ~ "`Email.key` performs `Time`" # an effect row on the key
stderr: ~ "jet-lang.dev/e/E0502" # the KeyBy contract code
step written: jet check written/main.jet
exit: 1
stderr: ~ "`impl Equatable` on `Email` is a second `Equatable` beside its `KeyBy`" # a hand-written equal
stderr: ~ "`Email` implements `KeyBy` here" # names the KeyBy declaration too
stderr: ~ "jet-lang.dev/e/E0908" # the second-rule code
step marker: jet check marker/main.jet
exit: 1
stderr: ~ "`#!Comparable` on `Email` is a second `Comparable` beside its `KeyBy`" # a signed marker
stderr: ~ "`Email` implements `KeyBy` here" # names the KeyBy declaration too
stderr: ~ "jet-lang.dev/e/E0908" # the second-rule code
step shared: jet check shared/main.jet
exit: 1
stderr: ~ "`Tracked` holds `Shared<Counter>`, so its key could change while it is stored" # a Shared field
stderr: ~ "jet-lang.dev/e/E0502" # the KeyBy contract code
step cycle: jet check cycle/main.jet
exit: 1
stderr: ~ "key of `Node` comes back to `Node`" # Node keys by Link, which keys by Node
step float: jet check float/main.jet
exit: 1
stderr: ~ "`Reading` can't be a map key type" # its key is a Float
stderr: ~ "jet-lang.dev/e/E0502" # the Map-key code
